  8663	/// Closed digest over test identity, executable name, requirement mapping, and
  8664	/// evidence kinds. Existence checks alone let a packet remap broad, unrelated
  8665	/// test names to satisfy coverage; this registry makes the authoritative
  8666	/// mapping tamper-evident (P1-A04). Recompute with the canonical NUL/US stream
